#: of pwnlib.memleak.MemLeak.clearb:1
msgid ""
"Clears byte at ``((uint8_t*)addr)[ndx]`` from the cache and returns the "
"removed value or `None` if the address was not completely set."
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.memleak.MemLeak.cleard:1
msgid ""
"Clears dword at ``((uint32_t*)addr)[ndx]`` from the cache and returns the"
" removed value or `None` if the address was not completely set."
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.memleak.MemLeak.clearq:1
msgid ""
"Clears qword at ``((uint64_t*)addr)[ndx]`` from the cache and returns the"
" removed value or `None` if the address was not completely set."
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.memleak.MemLeak.clearw:1
msgid ""
"Clears word at ``((uint16_t*)addr)[ndx]`` from the cache and returns the "
"removed value or `None` if the address was not completely set."
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.memleak.MemLeak.d:1 pwnlib.memleak.MemLeak.d:3
msgid "Leak dword at ``((uint32_t*) addr)[ndx]``"
msgstr ""

